  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/671/671-14.htm",
  "statuteText": "671:14 Qualifications. –\n\nAny person domiciled in the school district who is qualified to vote as provided in RSA 654:1 through 654:6 and who is on the school district checklist shall be entitled to vote at any school district election."
